<footer class="mt-10 space-y-1 border-t border-edge pt-4 text-xs text-soft print:hidden">
  <p>Shared from a self-hosted assistant. This link can be revoked by whoever sent it.</p>
  <%# The take-it-with-you half of D-share-link — only where there's an
      envelope behind the token: a recipe or a book, never an album. %>
  <% if local_assigns[:portable] %>
    <p>Run this app yourself? Paste this link into your own recipe import and it lands in your box.</p>
  <% end %>
</footer>
